cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this extended RAVE-SIM software, please cite this software release
  and the framework article listed in the references.
title: "RAVE-SIM: Really big/fast wAVE SIMulation"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Fan
    given-names: Sijie
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0003-6263-1852"
version: 2026.09.12
date-released: 2026-09-12
