url: "https://github.com/EVANOLON/3D_ravesim"
identifiers:
  - type: doi
    value: "10.5281/zenodo.22727145"
    description: Concept DOI representing all RAVE-SIM software versions
license: BSD-3-Clause
abstract: >-
  An extended RAVE-SIM release with CUDA-accelerated two-dimensional wave-field
  propagation, three-dimensional voxelized samples, two-dimensional
  area-weighted detectors, plasma-sample modeling, cone-beam/Fresnel geometry,
  and out-of-core two-dimensional FFT support.
